<h1 class="email-heading">Reset your password</h1>
<p class="email-text">
  Someone (hopefully you) asked to reset the password for your JobJournal account. This link works for the next 15 minutes.
</p>
<a href="<%= edit_password_url(@user.password_reset_token) %>" class="email-button">Choose a New Password</a>
<p class="email-fallback">
  Or paste this link into your browser:<br>
  <a href="<%= edit_password_url(@user.password_reset_token) %>"><%= edit_password_url(@user.password_reset_token) %></a>
</p>
<p class="email-note">
  If it wasn’t you, ignore this email. Your password won’t change unless the link is used.
</p>
